    "A day counts when you log something dated that day, or mark it as no spending, by the end of the next day. Every 7 days in a row earn a freeze, up to 2, which covers a missed day." : {
      "comment" : "How the streak works, at the bottom of the streak sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un día cuenta cuando anotas algo con esa fecha, o lo marcas sin gastos, antes de que termine el día siguiente. Cada 7 días seguidos ganas un protector, hasta 2, que cubre un día sin anotar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when a category reaches 80% and 100% of its monthly budget." : {
